The operating envelope is $\mathcal{E}_{\text{safe}} \subset \mathbb{R}^8$ on the environmental vector of Section 3.3. Debris flux $\rho_{\text{debris}}(t)$ is a component of $E(t)$, and the bay-exposure hazard is bounded by the requirement that $E(t)$ remain in $\mathcal{E}_{\text{safe}}$ throughout deployment.

